# Allow-list: only what the image needs. Everything else (.env, data/, secrets, OAuth tokens, resumes, databases,
# backups, logs, .venv, .git, tests, build artefacts) is never sent to the Docker build.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/requirements.lock
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/secrets
**/*token*.json
**/*client_secret*.json
